had enough of it.

00:13:58.871 --> 00:14:00.372
It goes against
their experience.

00:14:00.372 --> 00:14:02.374
It's tearing apart workplaces,

00:14:02.374 --> 00:14:04.476
and people are starting
to finally speak out.

00:14:04.476 --> 00:14:08.380
I think your show, certainly
Weinstein and James Lindsey

00:14:08.380 --> 00:14:10.583
and Peter Boghossian
and Helen Pluckrose,

00:14:10.583 --> 00:14:12.818 align:start size:84% position:16%
they laid a
theoretical foundation

00:14:12.818 --> 00:14:14.854
