00:14:14.854 --> 00:14:17.156
but what I'm trying to do and
what others are trying to do

00:14:17.156 --> 00:14:19.391
is trying to put
that into action

00:14:19.391 --> 00:14:21.527
and actually elevate
some of those ideas

00:14:21.527 --> 00:14:23.562 align:start size:81% position:19%
into a position
of political power

00:14:23.562 --> 00:14:26.131
in fighting against
critical race theory

00:14:26.131 --> 00:14:28.801
in every institution
in the United States

00:14:28.801 --> 00:14:32.171
and not giving an inch,
because if we allow this

00:14:32.171 --> 00:14:35.975
to essentially take over
our public institutions,

00:14:35.975 --> 00:14:38.110
in my view, it's the
